WEBVTT

00:04.010 --> 00:06.150
<i>My name is Ikusaba Asahi.</i>

00:06.730 --> 00:09.110
<i>I'm a full-fledged adventurer,
even if I don't look it!</i>

00:14.490 --> 00:16.330
What? Is the building not up to code?

00:16.330 --> 00:18.120
No, this is...

00:18.340 --> 00:21.450
Could it be that old mainstay
 of dungeon stages?

00:21.450 --> 00:22.710
Maya-nee, get back!

00:26.500 --> 00:29.130
There it is! A boulder trap!

00:29.130 --> 00:31.260
You look like you're having fun, Asahi.

00:31.490 --> 00:34.440
<i>Don't panic! Don't panic! 
As a full-fledged adventurer, I should...</i>

00:34.440 --> 00:36.260
Um, when stuff like this happens...

00:36.260 --> 00:37.510
This way!

00:38.660 --> 00:40.130
Maya-nee, hurry!

00:43.230 --> 00:44.230
Maya-nee!

00:52.570 --> 00:54.570
Come on. Let's keep moving.

00:58.570 --> 00:58.610
<b>Rainbow
Mushroom</b>

00:58.570 --> 00:58.610
<b>Organic
Bamboo
Shoot</b>

