02:28.000 --> 02:30.960
<b>Episode
5</b>

02:28.000 --> 02:30.960
<b>The Ikusaba Brother and</b>

02:28.000 --> 02:30.960
<b>Sister's</b>

02:28.000 --> 02:30.960
<b>Big Dungeon Exploration Plan</b>

02:30.960 --> 02:33.250
<b>Adventurers' Guild</b>

02:31.880 --> 02:33.250
A dungeon in some ruins?

02:33.250 --> 02:34.010
Yes.

02:34.440 --> 02:38.290
Someone found what looks like 
an entrance deep in the Claudio Forest.

02:38.290 --> 02:41.300
So exploring this place is 
my quest this time, huh?

02:41.300 --> 02:42.560
Bingo.

02:42.560 --> 02:44.650
If it turns out not to be dangerous,

02:44.650 --> 02:49.390
it'll be opened up to adventurers who, 
unlike you, Asahi-kun, are low-ranked!

02:49.390 --> 02:52.570
Right, right. Unlike me.

02:52.120 --> 02:53.360
<b>(Thanks 
to Maya)</b>

02:52.120 --> 02:53.360
<b>(Thanks 
to Maya)</b>

02:52.120 --> 02:53.360
<b>High-Ranked!</b>

02:52.120 --> 02:53.360
<b>High-Ranked!</b>

02:53.780 --> 02:57.270
But why is a place like that 
only being discovered now?

02:57.270 --> 03:01.420
Some mysterious natural disaster 
altered the landscape in that area.

03:01.420 --> 03:03.370
A natural disaster?

03:03.370 --> 03:08.490
Either that, or two fighters with unfathomable
 powers clashed. That's one rumor, anyway.

03:10.750 --> 03:11.720
Right...

03:11.720 --> 03:15.840
Which is why we're asking our hero, 
Asahi-kun, to take this one on.

03:15.840 --> 03:17.590
"Hero"?

03:17.590 --> 03:19.560
Can we ask this of you?

03:19.560 --> 03:21.340
Leave it to me!

03:25.710 --> 03:27.600
"Hero," huh?

03:27.830 --> 03:32.130
Even with my strength, I should be 
able to handle a quest of this difficulty.

03:39.210 --> 03:42.530
I'll never make progress if 
Maya-nee protects me all the time.

03:45.850 --> 03:47.450
Oh, there it is!

03:47.450 --> 03:49.700
The dungeon entrance.

03:50.080 --> 03:53.210
<i>Okay! As a full-fledged, 
high-ranked adventurer,</i>

03:53.210 --> 03:55.180
<i>I'm gonna handle things on my own today!</i>

03:55.180 --> 03:59.710
What's today's quest? Going off and leaving
 your sister behind was so cruel of you, Asahi.

04:01.890 --> 04:04.790
<i>So it still ended up like this anyway.</i>

04:04.790 --> 04:06.470
I was wondering, Asahi...

04:06.790 --> 04:11.280
Do ghosts like the one that was haunting
 the mansion appear in dungeons?

04:11.280 --> 04:12.490
Yeah, maybe.

04:12.490 --> 04:13.560
Aren't you scared?

04:14.150 --> 04:16.290
Stop treating me like a kid.

04:16.290 --> 04:18.650
I'm technically Ogre Class, you know.

04:19.130 --> 04:20.610
A-sa-hi.

04:20.610 --> 04:21.280
What now?

04:24.200 --> 04:25.860
Should we take one as a souvenir?

04:25.860 --> 04:29.250
It might be a cursed item! 
Just leave it! Put it down!

04:30.390 --> 04:33.280
Say, Asahi, your big sister 
wants you to teach her.

04:33.280 --> 04:34.550
Teach you what?

04:34.550 --> 04:36.650
Well, what <i>is</i> a dungeon, anyway?

04:36.650 --> 04:37.670
Seriously?

04:37.900 --> 04:42.840
Dungeon: a word that makes 
the hearts of RPG lovers leap.

04:43.740 --> 04:46.960
The enclosed, labyrinthine structure...

04:46.960 --> 04:50.140
The monsters and traps
 that hinder adventurers...

04:50.140 --> 04:54.020
The lingering traces 
of ancient cultures...

04:54.020 --> 04:57.610
And waiting at the deepest level, 
the master of the labyrinth.

04:58.060 --> 05:02.590
There's such romance in exploring dungeons! 
It's the <i>true</i> pleasure of an isekai fantasy!

05:03.000 --> 05:07.070
I don't really understand, but you seem 
to be having fun and that's the important thing.

05:07.720 --> 05:10.840
Well, in any case, just make sure 
you don't get separated from me.

05:10.840 --> 05:11.830
All right.

05:11.830 --> 05:14.790
Now, listen. Here's how 
you conquer a dungeon.

05:16.250 --> 05:18.540
There's this thing called the "left-hand rule."

05:18.540 --> 05:21.160
If you keep your hand on 
the wall like this as you go,

05:21.160 --> 05:24.380
you're guaranteed to 
eventually reach the end.

05:28.680 --> 05:30.470
A-A trap?!

05:30.780 --> 05:32.200
Are you all right, Asahi?

05:32.200 --> 05:33.310
Yeah.

05:33.310 --> 05:34.780
Is this a dangerous route?

05:34.780 --> 05:37.440
Hey, hold on. I'm giving the directions here...

05:37.700 --> 05:39.770
I pushed something else?!

05:40.120 --> 05:40.650
What?!

05:41.450 --> 05:42.360
Maya-nee!

05:49.300 --> 05:51.950
No problem! Your big sister's fine!

05:52.880 --> 05:54.220
I'm glad.

05:57.690 --> 06:00.810
Th-That's probably not something 
normal humans can do.

06:13.020 --> 06:15.410
It's suddenly gotten chillier, hasn't it?

06:15.950 --> 06:17.710
Do you want my jacket?

06:17.710 --> 06:18.810
Oh, thank y—

06:19.560 --> 06:21.330
Watch out. Something's coming.

06:27.530 --> 06:29.030
U-Undead!

06:29.290 --> 06:33.620
They're protecting the dungeon. For now, 
I suppose we can call them Skeletal Knights.

06:34.340 --> 06:36.410
I will return them to the underworld.

06:37.250 --> 06:38.830
No! Stop!

06:42.630 --> 06:45.130
S-Sorry, Maya-nee.

06:45.130 --> 06:46.370
Asahi.

06:49.890 --> 06:51.330
What are you doing?

06:51.330 --> 06:54.950
A dark, secret chamber. 
Siblings who love each other.

06:55.260 --> 06:57.320
It'd be impossible for <i>nothing</i> to happen.

06:57.320 --> 06:58.950
That's not what this is!

06:58.950 --> 07:00.390
Oh, it isn't?

07:00.650 --> 07:04.470
If you unleash your immense magic in a place
 like this, what do you think'll happen?

07:04.470 --> 07:05.900
What will happen?

07:05.900 --> 07:09.220
The dungeon will collapse, 
and we'll be buried alive!

07:09.220 --> 07:11.070
I see. You're absolutely right.

07:13.750 --> 07:15.870
<i>We can't use Maya-nee's magic.</i>

07:15.870 --> 07:17.740
<i>Which means this is...</i>

07:17.970 --> 07:20.230
...where I need to make a stand!

07:20.020 --> 07:21.180
<b>Skill Owned</b>

07:20.020 --> 07:21.180
<b>Stone-Throwing</b>

07:23.630 --> 07:24.920
Take this!

07:26.860 --> 07:27.940
<b>Skill Owned</b>

07:26.860 --> 07:27.940
<b>Batting</b>

07:42.810 --> 07:45.810
<i>Even without using magic,
 she's freaking strong.</i>

07:45.810 --> 07:47.190
Shall we continue onward?

07:47.190 --> 07:49.320
I ended up being protected, after all.

07:53.920 --> 07:55.820
This is the deepest part.

07:59.530 --> 08:02.540
Seems the "master of the labyrinth"
 or whatever isn't here.

08:02.540 --> 08:07.750
Hmm. It doesn't look like we'll have
 a boss battle here. That's a relief.

08:11.360 --> 08:14.050
Those are technically... monsters?

08:17.740 --> 08:22.100
Are they the offspring of the 
Kaiser Bear Kilmaria defeated?

08:26.740 --> 08:28.150
You sure are cute.

08:28.150 --> 08:29.860
But this is problematic.

08:30.250 --> 08:35.820
If we open up their hiding place, other 
adventurers will come to eliminate them.

08:35.820 --> 08:37.570
What should we do, Asahi?

08:37.570 --> 08:38.030
Huh?

08:38.520 --> 08:42.410
What do your "dungeon-conquering" methods
 say is the right thing to do here?

08:43.940 --> 08:45.290
The right thing...

08:46.870 --> 08:48.580
Let's head back, Maya-nee.

08:49.110 --> 08:53.130
This dungeon is currently unstable. 
There's a high chance it'll collapse.

08:53.560 --> 08:56.220
I can't recommend opening it up.

09:01.310 --> 09:02.470
I see.

09:03.130 --> 09:04.250
Yes, you're right.

09:12.400 --> 09:14.810
Finally. Some fresh air.

09:14.810 --> 09:16.780
We had a few heart-pounding situations, huh?

09:17.600 --> 09:19.780
Did you say "heart-pounding"?

09:19.780 --> 09:23.190
Asahi, have you heard of 
the suspension bridge effect?

09:23.190 --> 09:24.040
What's that?

09:24.570 --> 09:26.960
Men and women who have 
faced danger together

09:26.960 --> 09:29.960
fall in love with each other easier.
 It's psychological.

09:31.500 --> 09:35.420
Dungeon trips are perfect for ships!

09:33.700 --> 09:35.930
Shaddup!

09:35.420 --> 09:37.260
Asahi! Asahi!

09:37.260 --> 09:38.930
Hey! Get away from me!

09:38.330 --> 09:41.350
I wuv you! I wuv you!

09:39.290 --> 09:41.350
Cut that out already!

09:41.750 --> 09:45.050
I've told you over and over 
to stop treating me like a kid!

09:45.710 --> 09:46.880
Are you saying...

09:47.600 --> 09:50.730
you want to move on from your big sister?

09:50.730 --> 09:54.990
It's not that. I'm just hungry, 
so I want to hurry up and go home.

09:54.990 --> 09:56.940
You're hungry? Understood!

09:57.570 --> 09:58.850
Hey, wait!

09:59.530 --> 10:01.960
As usual, she goes at her own pace.

10:02.380 --> 10:06.290
Though since it's Maya-nee's pace,
 it'd be Maya-pace... I guess?

10:10.090 --> 10:11.710
Huh? What?

10:15.300 --> 10:16.510
Hang on.

10:16.510 --> 10:19.330
Hang on!

